// Title: Nile complex number type and multiplication operator
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2011-004 (STEPS 2011 progress report), Section 'Graphics' / Nile syntax; listing after 'Complex number type and multiplication operator'; PDF pages 11-12 (printed pages 10-11; the listing breaks across the page).
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.
type Complex = (a:Real, b:Real)
  (z1:Complex) (z2:Complex) : Complex
      ((a, b), (c, d)) = (z1, z2)
      (ac - bd, bc + ad)

// Transcription notes
// - Joined across the page break (PDF p. 11 bottom, PDF p. 12 top) as one listing.
// - Indentation as printed; exact space counts may differ slightly.
// - The text layer and the page image agree on all lines.
